{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月16日，諾和諾德公佈了其3期STEP Young試驗結果，相關論文發表於《新英格蘭醫學雜誌》（NEJM）。研究發現，在6歲至不滿12歲的肥胖兒童中，使用司美格魯肽治療68周後，其BMI的平均百分比下降幅度顯著高於安慰劑組。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587074.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:54.890120+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:19:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_hash":"6c15c178726cb1e1187490815886eefd45326e459429d840d38924c40d482f5a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}